# Privacy audit allowlist. Format: RULE|path-prefix|reason   (lines starting with # are comments)
# Every entry is a reviewed exception; add one only with a reason a reviewer can check.
SIGNPOST|Packages/IBoardCore/Sources/IBoardCore/Perf.swift|signpost event carries a numeric footprint (privacy: .public), never text
STRDESC|iBoard/DictionaryStore.swift|DictionaryError cases carry only counts/versions (checked), shown in the companion app UI, never logged
PASTEBOARD|iBoardKeyboard/KeyboardViewController.swift|user-triggered cut/copy of the user's own selection (needs Full Access, P-23)
WRITE|Packages/IBoardCore/Sources/IBoardCore/AppCommands.swift|app-group command queue and shared snapshot plumbing: commands/settings only, no typed text
WRITE|Packages/IBoardCore/Sources/IBoardCore/Settings.swift|settings values only (height scale, number row, flags)
WRITE|Packages/IBoardCore/Sources/IBoardCore/Insights.swift|aggregate counters only (counts, no text)
WRITE|Packages/IBoardEngine/Sources/IBoardEngine/Personal/PersonalStorage.swift|the personal store itself (snapshot + journal), the one sanctioned place words persist
WRITE|Packages/IBoardEngine/Sources/IBoardEngine/Personal/AdaptiveTouchModel.swift|touch-offset statistics (numbers per key), no text
WRITE|Packages/IBoardOTP/Sources/IBoardOTP/OTPStore.swift|OTP codes with TTL, opt-in feature (docs/PRIVACY.md)
WRITE|Packages/IBoardUI/Sources/IBoardUI/PersonalInfo.swift|user-entered personal-info snippets the user chose to store
WRITE|Packages/IBoardUI/Sources/IBoardUI/AppCommandApplier.swift|applies app commands to settings flags
WRITE|Packages/IBoardTheme/Sources/IBoardTheme/ThemeStore.swift|theme definitions and user-chosen theme photos
WRITE|iBoardKeyboard/EngineHost.swift|exports the personal store as shared/dictionary.iboarddict for the companion app (Full Access only)
WRITE|iBoardKeyboard/KeyboardViewController.swift|incognito flag only
WRITE|iBoardKeyboard/EmojiHost.swift|emoji recents/skin-tone preferences (emoji, not typed words)
WRITE|iBoardKeyboard/DebugOverlay.swift|overlay visibility flag
WRITE|Packages/IBoardUI/Sources/IBoardUI/DuoPolicy.swift|per-orientation split and fill-to-fold booleans (layout preferences, no text)
WRITE|Packages/IBoardUI/Sources/IBoardUI/CoachMarks.swift|first-run tip progress (one integer, no text)
WRITE|Packages/IBoardUI/Sources/IBoardUI/ClipboardHistory.swift|F9 clipboard history: copied (not typed) text, extension container only, Full Access only, max 20 items, TTL 1 h / 10 min for codes, expired items removed on save, never synced
